<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Macquarie Bank to pay 18 ct dividend.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Macquarie Bank to pay 18 ct dividend.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Macquarie Bank Ltd said on Tuesday it would pay an 18 cent per share dividend for the six months ended September 30.</p>
<p>The investment bank said the fully franked dividend would be paid on January 8 next year to shareholders registered on December 17.</p>
<p>Macquarie paid a 36 cent per share dividend in 1995/96 to March 31 but has not paid an interim dividend before.</p>
<p>Macquarie said its half year profit result would be issued on December 2.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
